Purée the @fresh raspberries{300%g}.

Stir in @icing sugar{60%g} to taste.

Sharpen the coulis with a squeeze of @lemon juice{to taste} or flavour with @?liqueur{a little}(crème de cassis).

Serve with @./Sweet/Truffle Torte{}.